{"ts":"2026-09-25T07:24:58Z","project":"NV-DPS-Internal","surface":"CSV import preview","status":"pending-review","axis":"density","decision":"Status sits beside Row with the skip reason under the badge; skipped rows sort first; cells stay on one line and the table scrolls sideways; the file/paste source collapses to a compact strip once rows parse","reason":"critique-screen P2: emails broke mid-word, rows grew ~100px tall and the preview was squeezed under the source area","source":"agent-pending","promote":false}
