{"ts": "2026-09-28T05:42:03Z", "project": "NV-DPS-Internal", "surface": "stat tiles (.kpi) at phone width", "status": "pending-review", "axis": "density", "decision": "at <=520px the icon sits on its own 28px row level with the corner arrow (arrow moved to the 14px content corner) and the title runs the full tile width; tiles use subgrid rows so title, value and note align across each row; linked tiles reserve 30px for the arrow above 520px", "reason": "critique-screen: icon + arrow reserve left ~86px of 146px, so 'Open financial periods' broke one word per line and values sat at different heights; now every linked title fits one line at 390px and desktop 1440px is pixel-identical", "source": "agent-pending", "promote": false}
{"ts": "2026-09-28T05:42:03Z", "project": "NV-DPS-Internal", "surface": "appraisal card (RM.apprCard) at phone width", "status": "pending-review", "axis": "structure", "decision": "at <=760px the card reflows to one column: person, then anniversary date + required-quarter chips, then a hairline footer row with the readiness badge left and View report right; the RM sub-line wraps instead of truncating", "reason": "the fixed minmax(220px) + auto status columns overflowed the page by 128px (Admin/PH) and 2px (My Appraisal); order follows who, when, outcome; footer echoes .card-foot / .tc-foot hairlines", "source": "agent-pending", "promote": false}
