{"ts":"2026-09-28T06:09:25Z","project":"NV-DPS-Internal","surface":"segmented controls, filter pills, rating buttons","status":"pending-review","axis":"interaction","decision":"hover adds a soft brand glow (--hover-glow: 1px blue-600 hairline + blurred halo; stronger in dark) and never recolours a selected or disabled label; segments use an inner glow (--hover-glow-in) faded in on a pseudo-element so it stays inside the track; fine pointers only; keyboard focus keeps the solid focus ring instead","reason":"user report: the selected segment's label vanished on hover (ink text on the ink thumb); critique-screen P2s: a 3px spread ring read as a hard outline in dark and made the hovered inactive segment look selected; one hover language across the pill family","source":"agent-pending","promote":false}
