{"ts":"2026-09-28T06:43:50Z","project":"NV-DPS-Internal","surface":"Organization page","status":"pending-review","axis":"interaction","decision":"page opens on the plain tree (no preselected person, no dimming, no path highlight, ever); clicking a photo, a name label, a search result or a link in the card opens the details card; X (existing x-btn) or Esc closes it and returns focus; the URL carries ?id= so a link reopens the card","reason":"user asked for the default tree only, details on click, and a close button; the tree must not change","source":"agent-pending","promote":false}
