{"ts":"2026-09-28T06:43:50Z","project":"NV-DPS-Internal","surface":"Organization details card","status":"pending-review","axis":"density","decision":"label column sized to its longest label, review badges on their own full-width row, Reports-to link left-aligned, designation and ID on separate lines; at 1024px and below the card is a bottom sheet capped at min(52dvh, 520px) and the page scrolls the tree above it","reason":"critique-screen P2: the In manager review badge overflowed the 320px card and the phone sheet covered the whole tree","source":"agent-pending","promote":false}
