{"ts":"2026-09-30T10:30:00Z","project":"NV-DPS-Internal","surface":"Practice Head overview (DPS dashboard)","status":"pending-review","axis":"hierarchy","decision":"three numbered sections in the Practice Head's priority order: Revenue & Budget (one hero card with a primary top rule, the page's only 52px figure, filled 1 chip), Team Investment (standard tiles, cards, full-width allocation table), Initiatives (one tracker table); flow chips under the lede jump to each section and focus its heading","reason":"Practice Head's brief: financial performance first, team investment second, initiatives third","source":"agent-pending","promote":false}
{"ts":"2026-09-30T10:30:00Z","project":"NV-DPS-Internal","surface":"Revenue forecasting chart","status":"pending-review","axis":"color","decision":"monthly columns (24px, 4px rounded top) with an ink budget tick; actual --viz-actual, forecast --viz-forecast on a shaded forecast zone; the pair validated as an ordinal ramp in both themes; Chart/Table switch is the table twin; the chart keeps 520px and scrolls sideways under 760px","reason":"forecast is a less certain step of the same measure, not a second category; its light step is under 3:1 so exact values need a table view","source":"agent-pending","promote":false}
