{"ts":"2026-09-30T17:31:29Z","project":"NV-DPS-Internal","surface":"Organization card <-> resource profile transition","status":"pending-review","axis":"motion","decision":"shared-element avatar morph (card 56px to hero 88px, 360ms power3.inOut); the old view fades out in 140ms power2.out (was power1.in: the exit is the click's first response); the tree side only fades (no transform: the phone sheet is fixed and the canvas has its own CSS shift); the profile slides in from the right (+28px) and back out to the right; on return the tree arrives already drawn and focus goes back to Open profile; about 530ms end to end; reduced motion swaps instantly","reason":"interaction-design-toolkit animation principles and Doherty threshold; tastemaker motion gate flags ease-in on UI responses; replaying the tree's first-visit entrance on return read as a reload","source":"agent-pending","promote":false}
