{"ts":"2026-09-30T18:40:13Z","project":"NV-DPS-Internal","surface":"Goal sheet review (BA & Sr BA) navigation","status":"pending-review","axis":"structure","decision":"BA and Senior BA get 'Goal Sheet Review' under My Performance (after My Reviews) with Monthly | Quarterly tabs; their reporting managers get 'Team Goal Sheets' under My Reporting Team with the same tabs and a reportee strip; no other role sees either; the tabs are another view of the existing review records, so status, history, due dates, My Reviews and the Practice Head's completion figures stay in step","reason":"user asked for monthly and quarterly tabs for BA and Sr BA and manager tabs for their reporting managers only, from the RMFVS proposal wireframes; one record per review avoids two review systems drifting apart","source":"agent-pending","promote":false}
{"ts":"2026-09-30T18:40:13Z","project":"NV-DPS-Internal","surface":"Goal sheet table (monthly and quarterly)","status":"pending-review","axis":"interaction","decision":"category pill tabs with an orange dot while a tab has goals to score; monthly scores use the existing 1-5 rating buttons, quarterly scores a small number box out of the goal's split with live totals; manager scores that differ from self get an --orange-50 cell and a '±1 vs self' label; manager scores and comments stay hidden from the employee until completed; drafts survive switching tab, cadence or person","reason":"wireframe content in the app's own components; Von Restorff reserved for differences; orange-ink on orange-50 is 4.53:1 light, 7.14:1 dark","source":"agent-pending","promote":false}
