{"ts":"2026-09-30T18:40:13Z","project":"NV-DPS-Internal","surface":"Goal sheet motion","status":"pending-review","axis":"motion","decision":"cadence and reportee switches: 120ms fade then the review enters from the side of travel (300ms power3.out, 40ms stagger); category tabs nudge 12px in the direction of travel (220ms); quarterly totals count and bars glide in place instead of re-rendering; missing scores pulse twice then stay outlined; submit and complete advance the lifecycle rail; reduced motion swaps instantly","reason":"interaction-design-toolkit spec; replacing the totals card made the bars jump","source":"agent-pending","promote":false}
{"ts":"2026-09-30T18:40:13Z","project":"NV-DPS-Internal","surface":"Resource profile tabs","status":"pending-review","axis":"structure","decision":"profile tabs Overview, Project allocation, Billing & profit, Review history, Salary history; hourly rates assume 160 billable hours a month (bill rate from the revenue goal, cost from monthly cost to company); profit is revenue minus cost over the FY's locked months with a revenue column and cost tick chart; salary history is worked back from today's cost to company, one increase per appraisal anniversary; charts are drawn near their shown width (1000 desktop, 560 phone); project start and ageing stay in Project allocation","reason":"user asked for hourly rates, profit, review history and salary history on the profile, and said to leave ageing as it is; page stays Admin and Practice Head only","source":"agent-pending","promote":false}
