{"ts":"2026-10-01T09:20:00Z","project":"NV-DPS-Internal","surface":"Goal sheet monthly form","status":"pending-review","axis":"structure","decision":"Monthly tab is a form: each goal is a card (summary eyebrow, detail as title, Weight %), the review deck's evidence table with the deck's columns as editable cells, then the score row (self, manager, comment) on a tinted footer; five category tabs kept; conversation moved into goal 11; quarterly tracker read-only in goal 12; wins celebration photo as an unscored card in Win Together","reason":"the user asked for the PPT's values as a form inside the existing tabs; one card per goal keeps evidence next to the score it justifies","source":"agent-pending","promote":false}
